{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE5L1RoZSUyMFdoZWVsJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Wheel","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1P6SoZCSKrJp8sxooCbShwN2wpL.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uhEcqsb92l4kvJNB9KGraEGxM4X.jpg","description":"Sometime in the near future, paraplegic prison inmate Matt Mills meets \"The Board\" of Satoshi-Telefair Industries, who thank him for joining the Program. Under pressure and with a promise to make him walk again, Mills agrees to volunteer. He is injected with a synthetic nanomaterial and suffocated, only to wake up with restored use of his legs, yet alone in a steel cell in the first spoke of an experimental apparatus - The Wheel. A series of assailants inflict a multitude of damage to Mills' body and torment his mind, yet the synthetic nanomaterial not only restores his damaged organs, it re-engineers his strength. The experiment might be designed to kill, but Mills is determined to survive - and get back to his daughter before The Board finds her first.\n\nRated 15 · Released 2 Sept 2019 · Australia · Language: English · 82 min\nStudio: Sunjive Studios, The Wheel Production\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["Action","Science Fiction","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.0","runtime":"82 min","cast":["David Arquette","Jackson Gallagher","Kendal Rae","Belinda McClory","Christopher Kirby","Ben Steel","Matthew Connell","Anna Burgess"],"director":["Dee McLachlan"],"released":"2019-09-02T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Break him, till he breaks free.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Dee McLachlan","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pqIERAvjnkTESTPGD6032MHNxBG.jpg"},{"name":"David Arquette","character":"Dr. Emmett Snyder","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/74wJjoywG7zCrNMWbRxwoyOj7Ub.jpg"},{"name":"Jackson Gallagher","character":"Matthew Allen Mills","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lMZR7HRD